/*
:name: spec_syntax_backtick_underscore
:type: comptime
:verifier_pass: 2
:verifier_fail: 0
*/
// qa.md Q39 item 2 / Appendix §8: "bare `_` -> error in both (`` `_` `` is an ordinary name)";
// qa.md Appendix §8: "a backticked banned/reserved word (... `` `_0` ``, `` `_` ``) is an
// ordinary name; prpfmt must KEEP the backticks on them".
const `_`  = 8
const `_0` = 1

cassert(`_` == 8)
cassert(`_` + `_0` == 9)
